---

---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="badge">浏览器扩展 · 免费使用</div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      让 AI 对话<br />
      <span class="gradient-text">可读、可导航、可沉淀</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-desc">
      Ophel 为 ChatGPT、Gemini、Claude 等 15 个平台注入实时大纲、会话文件夹与 Prompt 词库。
      告别无限滚动，让每次对话成为可组织的知识。
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a
        href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore"
        class="btn-primary"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
          <path
            d="M10 6v8M7 11l3 3 3-3"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
        免费安装 Chrome 扩展
      </a>
      <a href="/docs" class="btn-secondary">查看文档</a>
    </div>

    <p class="hero-note">支持 Chrome · Edge · Firefox · 油猴脚本</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 背景装饰 -->
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 120px 24px 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(74, 240, 196, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 240, 196, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c6fff 0%, #4af0c4 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 32px var(--color-primary-glow);
    transition:
      opacity 0.15s,
      transform 0.15s,
      box-shadow 0.15s;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 40px var(--color-primary-glow);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition:
      background 0.15s,
      transform 0.15s;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .hero-note {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -120px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 800px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(124, 111, 255, 0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
</style>
